cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If crawlward helps you understand who really crawls your site, consider citing it."
title: crawlward
authors:
  - family-names: Quintana
    given-names: Jesús
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kinti/crawlward"
url: "https://github.com/kinti/crawlward"
abstract: >-
  A watchdog for AI crawlers at your own origin. crawlward classifies AI
  crawler traffic from Caddy, nginx and Apache access logs, verifies
  claimed identities against vendor-published IP ranges, and reports who
  really crawls — with zero dependencies.
keywords:
  - ai-crawlers
  - access-logs
  - robots-txt
  - caddy
  - nginx
  - log-analyzer
